  - key: tutorial-tooltip
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: Tutorial
  - key: tutorial-controls-tooltip
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: D - Next/A - Previous/Esc - Exit
  - key: tutorial-page-1
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: "Important principles:\r\nAlways monitor pressure; do not let it rise
        too high - otherwise the alarm will warn you in advance.\r\nAlways monitor
        your energy consumption: don\u2019t travel too fast, don\u2019t use the camera
        for no reason; no one will save you if it runs out.\r\nAlways monitor your
        oxygen and replace the tank - clients don\u2019t want to be left without
        their packages.\r\nAlways listen for noise behind the ship - the local life
        is always unpredictable.\r\nAnd remember: the company cares about you!"
  - key: tutorial-page-2
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: "Boat controls:\r\nThe boat\u2019s turning angle using the wheel.\r\nThe
        boat\u2019s speed using the lever.\r\nDiving/surfacing using the suspension
        lever.\r\n\r\nMap:\r\nGray \u2014 normal.\r\nLight blue \u2014 current.\r\nYellow
        \u2014 ???\r\nBrown \u2014 pressure zon.\nPurple \u2014 delivery point."
  - key: tutorial-page-3
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: "Environment photos:\r\nPhotograph the ship\u2019s surroundings to identify
        the cause of hull damage.\r\n\r\nIf you see a light - ascend quickly.\r\nIf
        you see someone below - swim away quickly.\r\nIf you see someone else - slow
        down and make no sound.\r\n\r\nGenerator repair:\r\nUnfortunately, we know
        very little about the conditions on this planet, so some systems may break.\r\nBut
        don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ve given you the ability to fix everything! Just
        connect a few wires in the generator and everything will work again!"
  - key: sensitivity-slider
    choiceMethod: 0
    values:
    - condition: 
      value: Sensitivity
